<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Password Reset Request</h1>
    <p>We received a request to reset your password for Crib on Rails.</p>
    <p>Your One-Time Password (OTP) is:</p>
    <h2 style="background-color: #f6f3ec; padding: 10px; display: inline-block; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: 2px;"><%= @otp %></h2>
    <p>This code will expire in <%= ENV['OTP_EXPIRATION_MINUTES'] || 5 %> minutes.</p>
    <p>If you did not request this, please ignore this email.</p>
  </body>
</html>
